      "text": "This is how you give your name. Word for word it is \"I am called …\". \"Hyggelig\" means \"pleasant\" or \"nice\": it is what you say when you meet someone. The longer \"Hyggelig å møte deg\" (\"nice to meet you\") comes soon. Notice that the verb never changes with the person: \"jeg heter\", \"Anna heter\".",
